  {
    title: "Doctors & Healthcare Professionals",
    desc: "Consultant physicians, surgeons, oncologists, cardiologists, pediatricians, medical researchers, and distinguished practitioners.",
    icon: `<svg class="w-6 h-6 text-[#f6dd9f]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M16 7a4 4 0 11-8 0 4 4 0 018 0zM12 14a7 7 0 00-7 7h14a7 7 0 00-7-7z"/></svg>`,
