    title: "CEOs, CFOs, CIOs/CTOs & Healthcare Leaders",
    desc: "Executive visionaries steering healthcare governance, financial sustainability, digital innovation, and patient experience transformation.",
    icon: `<svg class="w-6 h-6 text-[#f6dd9f]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M21 13.255A23.931 23.931 0 0112 15c-3.183 0-6.22-.62-9-1.745M16 6V4a2 2 0 00-2-2h-4a2 2 0 00-2 2v2m4 6h.01M5 20h14a2 2 0 002-2V8a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z"/></svg>`,
    badge: "Leadership Honors"
